direction_325 = location "Wild Bulcan" about "Wild Bulcan\nMoradon`s beasts; the most belligerent and savage of the bulcans who are shunned by their own" found "Moradon" at 502 415 in zone 21

On offer
    Say "I'm Moradon's Guardian, no, still just Sentinel Patrick. What did you want?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "This time Bulcan creatures have appeared, but they are more powerful. The creatures called Wild Bulcan look similar to regular Bulcan in appearance, but these creatures are more ferocious. Several mercenaries and peddlers have already been vicitimized by these Wild Bulcans. I think you can solve this matter for us this time too. Please hunt five Wild Bulcans, which are similar to but fiercer than Bulcan, and come back."

On in_progress
    Say "Hey, you must hunt at least five Wild Bulcans. Don't even think about going easy."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_325

On ready
    Say "Master, you've hunted down the Bulcans again. Hurry back to [Sentinel] Patrick."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "I should've asked you from the beginning. Thank you for taking care of it for me."
